  "readmeFile": "Readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.0 Improved disk writing and cancellation of the disk writer task.\n      1.3.0 Added support for AssemblyName in LoggerConfig.xml.\n      1.2.0 Added stream flush after the log entries are written to the stream writer. This forces the disk write of the buffer in case, the buffer is not full and constantly is filled with small chunks of data, making it to be flushed only after a long while.\n      1.1.1 Path.GetTempPath() method used for default log path if log path from config is not read properly.\n      1.1.0 Removed OS platform checks. Removed OS platform hardcoded default path, the default path is now current directory of the executable.\n      1.0.1 Syntax cosmetics.\n\t\t\t1.0.0 Initial release.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "verbatimVersion": "1.4.0",
